      "stem": "Which of the following improper integrals are convergent?\n\n$$\n\\text{I. } \\int_{-\\infty}^0 \\frac{1}{2 - 8x}\\,dx \\qquad \\text{II. } \\int_1^{\\infty} \\frac{e^{-\\sqrt{x}}}{\\sqrt{x}}\\,dx \\qquad \\text{III. } \\int_{-1}^2 \\frac{1}{x^2}\\,dx\n$$",
